Chief, the volcano's
going to erupt in ten minutes!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:16.400
What?!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.560
There's no time to explain.
It's going to blow in ten minutes!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.060
Hurry, Chief!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.240
L-Leave me... You two escape by yourselves.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:27.210
Are you kidding me? Why do you
think we came here in the first place?

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.300
She's right. We're taking you
with us, dead or alive!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.710
You have wonderful subordinates.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.950
However, I can't let any of you escape.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.680
Damn, he got us.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:48.860
That bastard Marcus refuses to go alone.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.990
He can die by himself for all I care!

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.710
I bet the doors downstairs
have been sealed shut, too.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.770
It's probably a lockdown
system for the weapons hanger.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.410
Yuri! What are you doing?

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.000
Get the Chief!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.980
So long, Marcus!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.350
What's that?

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:23.520
It's the capsule where all of this lab's
classified documents are stored.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.200
Whatever happens, we must protect those files.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.840
If it's this sturdy, it should be okay.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:30.440
Kei!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.370
All right, so we're escaping in that?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.880
Hey, what are you doing?

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.450
There's important research data in there!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:43.710
Our lives are more important than
any research, don't you think?

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:47.150
If it can't save us in such a dire situation,
it's probably not that important anyway.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:48.560
Kei, three minutes left!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.850
Okay, that should do it!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.580
You okay, Chief?

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.070
What now?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.730
Are we over the weight capacity?

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.200
Fine, I'll get out.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.400
What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:08.530
Oh, shut up!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.110
Two minutes left...

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.080
Kei?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.270
Kei, you're not!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:32.630
You bet I am.
Kei, you're not!

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:33.570
You bet I am.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:36.630
If we fire that thing at point-blank
range, we'll blow ourselves up!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.600
If we're going to blow up anyway,
it's worth a shot, isn't it?

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.680
Fingers crossed!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.880
We have the goddess of victory on our side!

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:25.480
Those two...

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.050
The Dirty Pair can't be dead.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.660
They can't be!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:55.780
Yuri...

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:57.710
Yuri!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.450
Yuri!

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:03.180
Yu... ri!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:06.650
Yuri, you're not dead, right?

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.130
Because...

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:12.600
We promised we'd go to Blue Lagoon
and eat cake together, didn't we?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.030
You're not dead!

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.630
Right?

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.970
Sorry, Yuri...

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.030
...for eating your cake...

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:26.080
I wasn't even that hungry...

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.650
I didn't know you were
looking forward to eating it.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.620
I didn't know!

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:33.190
But it's your fault, too!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:38.150
If that cake meant so much you to, you should
have hidden it somewhere I wouldn't find it!

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.830
Yuri, please come back!

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:44.090
I'll let you eat as many
Blue Lagoon cakes as you want!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.570
That's great and all, but... you're heavy.

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:54.410
That's what happens when you
steal people's cakes. You gain weight.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.240
Yuri?

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:56.610
Fatso.

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:59.850
You're alive!

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:01.480
Your face is a mess.

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:01.720
You're one to talk.
Your face is a mess.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:02.680
You're one to talk.

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:07.790
Oh, brother.

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:09.990
I still have to keep you
around as my partner, huh?

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:11.660
You think I want to partner with you?

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:14.630
Well, I don't want to partner with you, either!

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.260
Fine, I'll find someone else!

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:18.860
You'll never find anyone
who wants to partner with you!

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:49.700
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:56.270
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:02.710
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:09.170
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:11.750
Space Fantasy

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:16.020
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:18.230
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:22.130
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:28.540
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:34.630
It wouldn't matter to me, if I'd fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.540
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:41.520
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:47.680
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

