It just looks tight because it's white!

00:24:07.110 --> 00:24:09.640
Anyway, is it true that we'll get to
go surfing on our next mission?

00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:10.380
It's true.

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:13.280
But if you're getting excited over something
like that, it just proves you're still a kid.

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:15.710
If you can't enjoy the thrill,
